Note: Minimal smoke test for epl-string
Import "epl/official_packages/epl-string/src/main" As str

Create result1 equal to str.to_camel_case("hello world")
Say result1

Create result2 equal to str.to_snake_case("helloWorld")
Say result2

Create result3 equal to str.is_palindrome("racecar")
Say to_text(result3)

Create result4 equal to str.levenshtein_distance("kitten", "sitting")
Say to_text(result4)

Say "Done"
